## 3. Generation

$$
\boxed{\;
C_{0} = F \in X,
\qquad
C_{g+1} = O(C_{g}) = \tfrac{1}{2} C_{g},
\qquad
C_{g} = 2^{-g} F
\;}
$$

$$
g : \{C_{g}\}_{g \in \mathbb Z} \to \mathbb Z,
\qquad
g(C_{g}) := g
$$

