## 6. Configuration space

$$
\boxed{\;
\Pi_{231}
:=
\bigl\{\, \{\alpha_{i}, \alpha_{j}\} : i < j,\ \alpha_{i}, \alpha_{j} \in \mathcal A_{22} \,\bigr\}
\;}
